            <exercise>
                <statement>
                    <p>
                        Why are gloves useful when working with some radioactive
                        materials even though gloves may not stop penetrating
                        gamma rays?
                    </p>
                </statement>

                <answer>
                    <p>
                        Gloves can reduce contamination of the skin and prevent
                        radioactive material from being transferred or ingested.
                    </p>
                </answer>
            </exercise>

