                        What fraction remains after 24 h?
                    </p>
                </statement>

                <answer>
                    <p>
                        24 h is 4 half-lives, so <m>(1/2)^4=1/16</m>, or 6.25%.
                    </p>
                </answer>
            </exercise>
        </exercisegroup>
    </exercises>
</section>